OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed Team GB
OL,4,Atriathlete to be deported
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Romanian van driver jailed for
OL,7,Fkilling a Team GB triathlete by driving
OL,8,Finto the back of her bike has lost an
OL,9,Fappeal against being deported.
OL,11,FVasile Barbu, 50 was delivering
OL,12,Ffurniture to a driver in Calais when he
OL,13,Fhit Rebecca Comins' bike in June 2022.
OL,15,FBarbu drove straight into the back of
OL,16,FComins rather than move into an empty
OL,17,Flane of the dual carriageway. He was
OL,18,Fwas found guilty of causing her death
OL,19,Fby dangerous driving following a five
OL,20,Fday trial.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
