OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed Team GB
OL,4,Atriathlete to be deported
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the hearing in Newport, immigration
OL,7,Fjudge Ian Boyes said: "The nature of
OL,8,Fthe offending is important. This was
OL,9,Fnot an accident. It was not a slight
OL,10,Fmisjudgement. It was committed using a
OL,11,Fvehicle which should not have been on
OL,12,Fthe road."
